OL,3,GNEWSACouncil rejects rollercoaster
OL,4,Aoverlooking homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to keep a rollercoaster
OL,7,Foverlooking homes have been refused by
OL,8,Fa council.
OL,10,FThe prototype has been erected at a
OL,11,Fformer aerodrome near Sandford Lane, in
OL,12,FHucknall, Nottinghamshire, prompting
OL,13,Fcomplaints from residents about noise,
OL,14,Fvisual impact and a loss of privacy.
OL,16,FAshfield District Council rejected a
OL,17,Fretrospective application by fairground
OL,18,Foperator Mellors Group to use Grade II
OL,19,Flisted hangars at the Watnall Road site
OL,20,Fas a rollercoaster testing and storage
OL,21,Fsite on 20 October.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
