OL,3,GNEWSACouncil rejects rollercoaster
OL,4,Aoverlooking homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm said it would appeal against
OL,7,Fthe decision and believed there had
OL,8,Fbeen a "misunderstanding of what we are
OL,9,Fseeking to achieve and hope to work
OL,10,Ftowards an outcome that addresses the
OL,11,Fconcerns raised".
